# oracle: fix nve/manifold/rattle on a z-periodic cylinder of radius 6 (examples/PACKAGES/manifold/energy: cylinder.setup and energy.in, 500 LJ particles, pair lj/smooth/linear), 400 steps at dt 0.0005; temp counts one removed dof per constrained atom
# Native reference: LAMMPS b332f28 built with PKG_MANIFOLD (/store/shuvam/software/lammps-build-manifold/lmp; the installed binary has no MANIFOLD)
# Measured max relative error, engine vs native (thermo rows, final atoms): thermo 4.0e-15, atoms 2.6e-14.
# oracle-examples: PACKAGES/manifold/energy/cylinder.data
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all
units           lj
dimension       3
boundary        f f p
read_data       cylinder.data
fix             step all nve/manifold/rattle 1e-6 10 cylinder 6.0
pair_style      lj/smooth/linear 2.5
pair_coeff      * * 1.0 1.0
pair_modify     shift yes
timestep        0.0005
thermo_style    custom step temp pe ke etotal
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          40
run             400
